<title>USA: NAL Financial files for 2.5 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>NAL Financial files for 2.5 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>NAL Financial Group said on Friday it has filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed 2.5 million public share offering.</p>
<p>The specialized automobile finance company said it would offer two million shares and certain shareholders would offer up to 500,000 shares.</p>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc was the lead manager, and Piper Jaffray Inc and Sands Brothers &amp; Co Ltd were co-managers, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
